# ValidationResult node schema
# One row per validation execution
id,test_id,requirement_id,status,timestamp,evidence
# id: Unique identifier (e.g., VR-001)
# test_id: TestCase ID that was executed
# requirement_id: Requirement ID being validated
# status: pass|fail|skip|error
# timestamp: ISO 8601 execution timestamp
# evidence: Reference to test output, log, or artifact
